1. {"action":"search","queries":["gear","factory","network"],"libraries":["phosphor","lucide","tabler","heroicons"],"limit":10}
2. 从搜索结果选择 ID，例：{"action":"preview","icons":["phosphor:regular/gear","lucide:factory","heroicons:24/outline/cog-8-tooth"],"columns":3}
3. 调用已有图片读取工具读取 data.preview.path。不能仅看到路径就声称已查看图片。合并图中的编号、名称、库/样式与完整 ID 一一对应，data.items 也提供映射。
4. 确定图标后：{"action":"export","icons":["heroicons:24/outline/cog-8-tooth"],"formats":["svg","png"],"color":"#2563EB","size":512}
搜索不自动生成图片；预览也不等于逐个导出。每次操作返回独立输出目录。
